\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Diagnostics of the differentiable WP-MS binning strategy for a representative MoS$_{2}$ slice. Top row: discretized refractive-index map (bin lower bound $n_{L}$), smooth interpolation weights $w$, and histogram of the true refractive-index distribution with superimposed bin centers. Bottom row: spatial approximation error $n_{\mathrm  {true}}-n_{\mathrm  {fit}}$, error histogram on a log scale, and a 1D cross-section comparing the original and fitted refractive-index profiles.}}{16}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:wpm_binning_diagnostics}{{2}{16}{Diagnostics of the differentiable WP-MS binning strategy for a representative MoS$_{2}$ slice. Top row: discretized refractive-index map (bin lower bound $n_{L}$), smooth interpolation weights $w$, and histogram of the true refractive-index distribution with superimposed bin centers. Bottom row: spatial approximation error $n_{\mathrm {true}}-n_{\mathrm {fit}}$, error histogram on a log scale, and a 1D cross-section comparing the original and fitted refractive-index profiles}{figure.2}{}}
